<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>SkillConnect</title>

    <style>

        body{
            margin:0;
            font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background:#f5f5f5;
        }

        .navbar{
            display:flex;
            justify-content:space-between;
            align-items:center;
            padding:18px 40px;
            background:#111;
            color:white;
        }

        .nav-links a{
            color:white;
            text-decoration:none;
            margin-left:20px;
            font-weight:bold;
        }

        .hero{
            height:80vh;
            display:flex;
            flex-direction:column;
            justify-content:center;
            align-items:center;
            text-align:center;
            padding:20px;
        }

        .hero h1{
            font-size:48px;
            margin-bottom:10px;
        }

        .hero p{
            max-width:600px;
            font-size:18px;
            color:#555;
        }

        .btn{
            margin-top:25px;
            padding:12px 25px;
            font-size:16px;
            border:none;
            background:#0077ff;
            color:white;
            cursor:pointer;
            border-radius:5px;
        }

        .btn:hover{
            background:#005ed6;
        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="navbar">

    <h2>SkillConnect</h2>

    <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/login">Get Started</a>
    </div>

</div>


<div class="hero">

<h1>Share Skills. Learn Together.</h1>

<p>
SkillConnect is a community platform where developers can teach
technical skills like Web Development, Data Structures, Python,
Machine Learning and more.
</p>

<p>
Find mentors, share your knowledge, and grow with other developers.
</p>

<a href="/login">
<button class="btn">Explore Tutors</button>
</a>

</div>

</body>
</html>